  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DCP Sand Hills Interstate Pipeline, LLC is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC").&amp;#160; The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by the FERC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Operator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respondent has no employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respondent's properties are operated by Phillips 66 Pipeline LLC 66 as agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
